WHAT THIS COVERS, AND WHAT IT DOES NOT

This licence covers THIS MOD'S OWN SOURCE CODE and documentation only.

It does NOT cover, and cannot grant any rights to:

  * BioShock Infinite itself, its engine, assets, or any of its data. Those
    belong to their respective owners. You need your own legally obtained copy
    of the game for this mod to be of any use.

  * Screenshots of the game included in this repository for documentation.
    They depict copyrighted material and are included for the purpose of
    describing and illustrating the mod's behaviour.

  * The memory addresses and structure offsets referenced throughout the
    source. These are factual observations about how a particular build lays
    out its data, recorded so the mod can find what it needs at runtime. No
    game code is reproduced here.

NO GAME FILES ARE MODIFIED OR REDISTRIBUTED. The mod ships as a proxy DLL that
loads alongside the process and forwards every real call to the system library.
Deleting that one file uninstalls it completely.
